# These files are consumed by Linux tooling (Docker's parser, bash, Wine's Python).
# A CRLF checkout reproduces two bugs already hit on this project: a Dockerfile that
# fails to parse and dies at "scheduling build" with an empty log, and an entrypoint
# that crash-loops on /usr/bin/env: 'bash\r': No such file or directory.
* text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
